{"slug":"More_than_Luck","title":"More than Luck","cats":[],"headings":[{"id":"Nations","text":"Nations","level":2},{"id":"Details","text":"Details","level":2}],"html":"<p><b>More Than Luck</b> is an arcade map added to <a href=\"/OpenFront.io\" title=\"OpenFront\">OpenFront</a> in <a href=\"/Update_33.0\" title=\"Update 33.0\">Update 33.0</a> by <b>Patrick Plays Badly</b> — Five-leafed clover shaped map inspired by nuke trajectories.</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/More_than_Luck_map.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"640\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"1348\" data-file-height=\"1347\"><figcaption>The More Than Luck map.</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Nations\">Nations</h2></div>\n<p>The map features 35 named <a href=\"/Nations\" title=\"Nations\">nations</a>, including 1-2-3-4, 1-1-1-1, 0-0-0-0, 1-2-1-2, 7-7-7-7 and 1-0-0-4.</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Details\">Details</h2></div>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Categories:</b> Arcade</li>\n<li><b>Nations:</b> 35</li>\n<li><b>Public rotation frequency:</b> 7</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"See_also\">See also</h1></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">Maps</a></li><li><a href=\"/Update_33.0\" title=\"Update 33.0\">Update 33.0</a></li></ul>\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">Map preview from the <a href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/tree/main/map-generator/assets/maps/morethanluck\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenFront game files</a>.</div>","section":"Maps"}
